FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ManyMonsLockedInPen::
    .string "There are many DAEMONS locked\n"
    .string "away in the pen…$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_PenUnlockedMonsFled::
    .string "The pen door is unlocked. The\n"
    .string "DAEMONS appear to have DETACHED.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "Did you come here knowing it's TEAM\n"
    .string "CORPUS's WAREHOUSE?$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "What do you think you're doing?!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "He has CHANGED? People do not\n"
    .string "change. They get promoted.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Oh, now your DAEMON look strong.\n"
    .string "You're willing to sell them?\p"
    .string "Oh? You wanted to battle?$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Oh, but…\n"
    .string "Too much!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "We can give you a great price.\n"
    .string "Sell us your DAEMON!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "I got word about you from the\n"
    .string "others.\p"
    .string "But there's no way a kid like you'd\n"
    .string "know our BOSS SCORN!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Don't…you…dare…laugh…$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "Don't mess in the doings of adults,\n"
    .string "you jumped-up pip-squeak!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1Intro::
    .string "I don't know or care if what I'm\n"
    .string "doing is right or wrong…\p"
    .string "I just put my faith in SCORN and\n"
    .string "do as I am told.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1Defeat::
    .string "I…\n"
    .string "I'm shattered…$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1PostBattle::
    .string "You're doing things according to\n"
    .string "your beliefs and morals.\p"
    .string "I understand now…$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_MadeItSoYouCanComeBackThrough::
    .string "I've made it so you can come back\n"
    .string "in through there.\p"
    .string "Why don't you go get rested and\n"
    .string "refreshed for what lies ahead?\p"
    .string "The ADMIN after me outranks me\n"
    .string "thoroughly as a USER.\p"
    .string "You'd better steel yourself for one\n"
    .string "harsh challenge.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin2Intro::
    .string "That's quite enough of you playing\n"
    .string "the hero, kid.\p"
    .string "Spreading stories about how he\n"
    .string "is different now…\p"
    .string "It's such an obvious attempt to\n"
    .string "cause confusion in our ranks.\p"
    .string "Fortunately, we're not so ignorant\n"
    .string "to fall for the lies of a child!\p"
    .string "And now, I'll show you how scary an\n"
    .string "angry adult can be!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin2Defeat::
    .string "Urgh… You were too strong…\p"
    .string "… Th-that's SCORN's MARK!\p"
    .string "So you have met him. Recently.\p"
    .string "…Is it true, what they say?\n"
    .string "That he stopped in the middle\l"
    .string "of a sentence?$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin2PostBattle::
    .string "We will abandon this WAREHOUSE…\p"
    .string "But don't think this is over. I won't\n"
    .string "let this be the end.\p"
    .string "I will find SCORN. And I will\n"
    .string "resurrect TEAM CORPUS! I will…\p"
    .string "Until then, farewell!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ReportWithGraphsAndText::
    .string "A report with graphs and text is on\n"
    .string "the PORT monitor.\p"
    .string "“The Influence of Magnetic Waves\n"
    .string "on DAEMON Evolution”…\p"
    .string "… … … … … …\p"
    .string "It's too difficult to understand…$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GideonIntro::
    .string "I told you where I was taking it.\p"
    .string "Nobody owned it. I worked out\n"
    .string "where it was and I went and got\l"
    .string "it, which is more than anyone\l"
    .string "else did in forty years.\p"
    .string "You want it back. Fine.\n"
    .string "Then it is a price, and this is\l"
    .string "how mine is settled.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GideonDefeat::
    .string "…Well. Settled, then.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GideonPostBattle::
    .string "Take it. It was never worth what\n"
    .string "I was going to be paid for it.\p"
    .string "Most things are not.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GetLostLeaveMeBe::
    .string "What do you want now?\n"
    .string "Go on, get lost, leave me be.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GiovannisKidHasRedHair::
    .string "You are still here.\p"
    .string "You are not one of his. I have\n"
    .string "watched his people for a long\l"
    .string "time and they all stand the same\l"
    .string "way, and you do not.\p"
    .string "That is the whole of what I know\n"
    .string "about you. Good.$"


@  T-19. 8.2a: "Strip the cackle from the Dotted Hole scientist and the
@  argument underneath is his." He is a businessman. Nobody owned it, he
@  worked out where it was, he got there first, and he knows who pays.
FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_TyTheOtherThing::
    .string "One more thing, and it is not\n"
    .string "business.\p"
    .string "You will pass through BLANCHE.\n"
    .string "Everyone does, eventually.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ReceivedPayload::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the PAYLOAD.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_TyNotComing::
    .string "The name on it is enough. She\n"
    .string "will know the hand.\p"
    .string "…No. I am not coming.\p"
    .string "Go on. You have what you came\n"
    .string "for.$"

@  8.2a: the breakthrough is him hearing the sentence he already said, and
@  4.33's rule about never adjudicating applies here too -- nothing in this
@  room tells him what it means, and nothing tells the player either.
FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ScornHasNoticed::
    .string "I said something in that GYM and\n"
    .string "I have carried it since.\p"
    .string "That it has never said otherwise.\p"
    .string "It is a correct sentence. I have\n"
    .string "checked it four times.\p"
    .string "I cannot tell you why I keep\n"
    .string "checking it.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ScornStillChecking::
    .string "…it has never said otherwise.\p"
    .string "No. Still correct.$"
